    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 8.1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="8.1">[Not in D]</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="8.1" corresp="#wit-k">⁊ þæt man heonan forð læte manna gehwylcne, ge earmne ge eadigne, folcrihtes wyrðe;</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k">And þæt man heonan forð læte manna gehwylcne, ge earmne ge eadigne, folcrihtes wyrðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-k">and that henceforth all men, both rich and poor, shall be allowed the benefit of the law;</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k">And that henceforth all people, rich and poor, shall be granted their legal rights.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">und dass man hinfort jeden Menschen, so armen wie reichen, Landrechtes theilhaftig sein lasse,</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">and that henceforth every person, poor as well as rich, be allowed to share in folk-right,</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="250">[?]</note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">Vgl. [?] 1[?]</note>
        <note type="comparisonIncomplete">Some of Liebermann’s notes here are cut off in the gutter of the scan used, and are still to be completed.</note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#liebermann"><ref target="clause:VIIAtr_6-1">VII Atr 6.1</ref>; <ref target="clause:IICn_1-1">II Cn 1.1</ref></note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#kennedy" n="59"><ref target="clause:Cn-1018_part-009">Cn 1018 3–6</ref></note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#whitelock" n="462"><ref target="clause:IICn_Prol">II Cn Prol.</ref></note>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#wormald-mel" n="319"><ref target="clause:IICn_1-1">II Cn 1.1</ref></note>
      </div>
